1190 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Wolters Kluwer\nSenior Product Designer\nJun 2021 \055 Jul 2026  \055  Internacional \055 Remote\n\n\042 Designed complex financial B2B SaaS products for accounting and professional\055services firms across multiple international markets\056\n\042 Led end\055to\055end product design from discovery\054 customer interviews and research through product definition\054 interaction design\054 prototyping\054 validation and implementation collaboration\056\n\042 Designed complex financial workflows spanning client management\054 document management\054 portals\054 tasks\054 time tracking\054 e\055signature\054 permissions and tax\055related processes\056\n\042 Translated business rules\054 operational dependencies\054 regional requirements and technical constraints into clear and scalable product experiences\056\n\042 Partnered with Product\054 Engineering\054 Architecture\054 Business Experts and international stakeholders to define product direction and resolve cross\055product dependencies\056\n\042 Contributed to the evolution of a global Design System\054 improving consistency\054 accessibility and reusable interaction patterns across products\056\n\042 Used research\054 prototyping and validation to inform design decisions and communicate rationale to stakeholders across different markets\056\n\042 Explored AI\055assisted product experiences and built an AI agent concept\054 using rapid prototyping to investigate how AI could support users within complex workflows\056\n\nFrog\nSenior Product Designer \nFeb 2019 \055 Jun 2021 \055  Madrid\n\nDesigned digital products and connected experiences across Telef\363nica\047s mobile\054 TV and smart\055home ecosystem\056\n\042 Designed consumer\055facing experiences including Smart WiFi\054 Secure Connection and Living Apps across multiple devices\056\n\042 Designed complex operational tools\054 including a CMS and partner dashboard used to create\054 manage and monitor Living Apps\056\n\042 Defined user flows\054 interaction models\054 high\055fidelity prototypes and design specifications for research\054 testing and development\056\n\042 Collaborated with Product\054 Engineering\054 Research and Business teams throughout the product lifecycle\056\n\042 Balanced user needs\054 business goals and technical feasibility when presenting and defending design decisions\056\n\nFreelance experience\nFront\055end and Graphic Design\n\nDesigned and built responsive digital experiences\054 combining UX\057UI design\054 front\055end development and implementation to take concepts from idea to working product\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 1191 0 R
     /Pg 1156 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
